<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Minnesota Vibes</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #dfefff, #f8f3e8);
            color: #1f2a37;
        }

        .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(16, 52, 82, 0.7), rgba(16, 52, 82, 0.7)),
                        url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511497584788-876760111969?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80') center/cover no-repeat;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 120px 20px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .tagline {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        .content {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 0 20px 60px;
        }

        .card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
            border: 1px solid #d0d7de;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #0d3b66;
            margin-top: 0;
        }

        .features {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 24px;
        }

        .feature {
            background: #edf6ff;
            border-left: 6px solid #2f7f72;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 18px;
        }

        .footer {
            background: #12314a;
            color: #f3f7fb;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header class="hero">
        <h1>Welcome to Minnesota</h1>
        <p class="tagline">Lakes, woods, and the spirit of the North</p>
    </header>

    <main class="content">
        <section class="card">
            <h2>Land of 10,000 Lakes</h2>
            <p>
                Minnesota is known for its calm lakes, vibrant forests, and welcoming communities.
                From peaceful summer evenings to snowy winter adventures, the North Star State has a beauty all its own.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="features">
            <div class="feature">
                <h3>Scenic Trails</h3>
                <p>Explore wooded paths, river overlooks, and beautiful state parks.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature">
                <h3>Fresh Air</h3>
                <p>Enjoy crisp mornings, open skies, and clean, natural surroundings.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature">
                <h3>Local Flavor</h3>
                <p>Find cozy diners, craft brews, and hearty comfort food around every corner.</p>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="footer">
        Minnesota vibes, all year long.
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
